{"id":"n41503-1-7","stage":5,"title":"단적 · 清楚","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41503-1-7-1","ko":"유민 씨 별명이 고양이라면서요?","zh":"听说裕敏的绰号是猫咪对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏","readings":[{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별명이","meaning":"别名，外号，绰号","explanation":"별명：别名，外号，绰号；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"별명","audio":"/audio/0a38607b93981aee3250.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14480","senseId":"1","lemma":"별명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고양이라면서요?","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라면서：引用听来的名词判断或命令，向对方确认；加 요 更礼貌。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"0a38607b93981aee","term":"별명","zh":"别名，外号，绰号","audio":"/audio/0a38607b93981aee3250.mp3","entryId":"14480","definition":"与原来的名字不同的、根据对象的特征另起的名字。","pronunciation":["별명"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd4a44e49fd06f7e3b90.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41503-1-7-2","ko":"네. 유민 씨의 외모를 단적으로 나타내는 별명이죠.","zh":"对呀。这正是能精准形容裕敏外貌的绰号呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유민","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏","readings":[{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨의","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외모를","meaning":"外貌，外表","explanation":"외모：外貌，外表；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"외모","audio":"/audio/2b872bd16206aa00739f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22154","senseId":"1","lemma":"외모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단적으로","meaning":"清楚","explanation":"단적：清楚；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"단적","audio":"/audio/10ea26fd04fffd37976e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41503","senseId":"1","lemma":"단적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나타내는","meaning":"表示","explanation":"나타내다：表示；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나타내다","audio":"/audio/36d31912afbbf3f2bd06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66316","senseId":"4","lemma":"나타내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별명이죠.","meaning":"别名，外号，绰号","explanation":"별명：别名，外号，绰号；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"별명","audio":"/audio/0a38607b93981aee3250.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14480","senseId":"1","lemma":"별명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"2b872bd16206aa00","term":"외모","zh":"外貌，外表","audio":"/audio/2b872bd16206aa00739f.mp3","entryId":"22154","definition":"人表面看到的模样。","pronunciati